---
source: tests/cli_root.rs
expression: out
---
Store S3 credentials and defaults in config

Usage: qam s3 set [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --endpoint <endpoint>
          S3 endpoint URL
      --config <path>
          Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --region <region>
          S3 region (default us-east-1)
      --bucket <bucket>
          Default S3 bucket
      --prefix <prefix>
          Default object key prefix
      --key-template <key-template>
          Default object key template
      --access-key-id <access-key-id>
          S3 access key ID
      --secret-access-key <secret-access-key>
          S3 secret access key
      --session-token <session-token>
          Optional STS session token
      --addressing <addressing>
          Addressing style: auto|path|virtual
      --public-url <public-url>
          Optional public base URL for printed links
      --storage-class <storage-class>
          Optional x-amz-storage-class header value
  -h, --help
          Print help
